  "text": "Protect your merchant account and store rating with this simple inventory rule. High cancellation rates from sold-out items will get your Stripe or PayPal account flagged. The breakdown occurs when orders flood in while you are away from your supplier dashboards. Instead, configure an automated threshold in AutoDS that marks Shopify items sold-out when supplier stock hits five. You safeguard your processing accounts.",
